      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing im struggling with is how to frame the 1948 period. i see a lot of different stuff written about it—some people call it the war of independence and others call it the Nakba. from a historical standpoint, how should i actually describe what happened there? like what's the actual consensus on why the displacement occurred?",
